Scope

Published on a non-commercial basis. Nothing here is sold, and no advertising,
sponsorship, subscription or donation is taken against it. This project uses no
Cloud Imperium assets, artwork or branding. It stores no game data: every answer
is fetched on demand from the sources below and kept only in the user's own
cache folder. The optional live telemetry reads the game's own local feature on this
computer only, keeps it in memory, and is off unless the user turns it on; it is an undocumented game feature that
Cloud Imperium has neither allowed nor forbidden as far as we know (see docs/TELEMETRY.md).

